      "id": "theme-home",
      "title": "Homepage mission and feature sections",
      "source_file": "wp-content/themes/dynetxdev2020/home.php",
      "content": "<div class=\"container-fluid section section-intro facelifting\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-10\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"h2 h2-new h2-new-thin\">expanding what&rsquo;s possible for people living with genetically driven neuromuscular diseases</h1>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-intro-text\">We&rsquo;re on a mission to deliver functional improvement for individuals, families and communities living with neuromuscular diseases. Functional improvement can mean achieving simple but meaningful activities like zipping a jacket, climbing up stairs or completing a morning routine. Dyne was built with one purpose: To help make these moments possible for the people who need them most. With this clear goal in mind, we work every day to deliver potentially life-changing therapies.</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row section-intro-cards\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-4 section-intro-card\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"section-intro-card-icon\" src=\"/images/icons/intro/ico-intro-pioneering.svg\" alt=\"Pioneering approach icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"h5 h5-new\">Pioneering approach</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-intro-card-text\">Our FORCE™ platform delivers therapies that address the root cause&nbsp;of disease</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/our-forcetm-platform/\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\">Discover our science</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-4 section-intro-card\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"section-intro-card-icon\" src=\"/images/icons/intro/ico-intro-pipeline.svg\" alt=\"Clinical-stage pipeline icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"h5 h5-new\">Clinical-stage pipeline</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-intro-card-text\">Advancing therapies for DMD, DM1,&nbsp;FSHD and other long-underserved&nbsp;conditions</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/pipeline/\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\">Explore our pipeline</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-4 section-intro-card\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"section-intro-card-icon\" src=\"/images/icons/intro/ico-intro-trial.svg\" alt=\"Part of team icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"h5 h5-new\">Want to be part of <br class=\"d-none d-sm-block\">a&nbsp;clinical trial?</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-intro-card-text\">We&rsquo;re studying potential therapies for&nbsp;DMD, DM1 and other conditions</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/clinical-trials/\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\">See if you may qualify</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"container-fluid section bg-indigo-blue section-committed facelifting\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"bg-img\">\n\t\t\t\t<picture>\n\t\t\t\t\t<source srcset=\"/images/committed/committed-mobile@2x.webp\" media=\"(max-width: 767.98px)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<source srcset=\"/images/committed/committed-desktop@2x.webp\" media=\"(min-resolution: 1.5dppx)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/images/committed/committed-desktop.webp\" alt=\"Family spending time together outdoors\">\n\t\t\t\t</picture>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-6 offset-md-1 section-committed-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"h4 h4-new\">Committed to the community</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"body-1 body-1-new\">Every decision we make starts with the people living with neuromuscular diseases and the families and communities beside them.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/our-commitment/\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-xl\">Read their stories</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"container-fluid section section-culture facelifting\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 col-md-5 order-md-2 section-culture-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"h4 h4-new\">Culture and careers</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"body-1 body-1-new\">Our commitment to people living with neuromuscular diseases isn&rsquo;t just our mission, it&rsquo;s what draws extraordinary people to this work. Hear our Dynamos share what makes Dyne a special place to be.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/careers-culture/#HfD\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-xl\">Learn more</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 order-md-1 section-culture-photos\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<picture>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<source srcset=\"/images/culture/culture-photos-mobile@2x.webp\" media=\"(max-width: 767.98px)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/images/culture/culture-photos-desktop.webp\" alt=\"Dyne employees\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</picture>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"container-fluid section section-news bg-deep-blue facelifting\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"bg-img bg-img-left\">\n\t\t\t\t<picture>\n\t\t\t\t\t<source srcset=\"/images/news/news-mobile@2x.webp\" media=\"(max-width: 767.98px)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<source srcset=\"/images/news/news-desktop@2x.webp\" media=\"(min-resolution: 1.5dppx)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/images/news/news-desktop.webp\" alt=\"Dyne Therapeutics office building\">\n\t\t\t\t</picture>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-6 offset-md-6 col-lg-7 offset-lg-5 offset-xl-4 section-news-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"h2 h2-new h2-new-light\"><span>Latest</span> <span class=\"h2-new-medium\">news</span></h2>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>",
      "text": "expanding what’s possible for people living with genetically driven neuromuscular diseases We’re on a mission to deliver functional improvement for individuals, families and communities living with neuromuscular diseases. Functional improvement can mean achieving simple but meaningful activities like zipping a jacket, climbing up stairs or completing a morning routine. Dyne was built with one purpose: To help make these moments possible for the people who need them most. With this clear goal in mind, we work every day to deliver potentially life-changing therapies. Pioneering approach Our FORCE™ platform delivers therapies that address the root cause of disease Discover our science Clinical-stage pipeline Advancing therapies for DMD, DM1, FSHD and other long-underserved conditions Explore our pipeline Want to be part of a clinical trial? We’re studying potential therapies for DMD, DM1 and other conditions See if you may qualify Committed to the community Every decision we make starts with the people living with neuromuscular diseases and the families and communities beside them. Read their stories Culture and careers Our commitment to people living with neuromuscular diseases isn’t just our mission, it’s what draws extraordinary people to this work. Hear our Dynamos share what makes Dyne a special place to be. Learn more Latest news",
